{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/General Store/Mr. Bag Error letter.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Mr. Bag Error": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "If Mr. Bag throws error code 3 24 8 22 please contact me immediately! That code is related to the self-defense mechanism which is only in the experimental stage. It can cause minor injury to someone if he is not treated!\n\nYou don't have to worry about error code 10 26 14 2. It's just some small bug with Mr. Bag and it should not affect the system in any way!\n\nIn any case, I hope you are happy with him! Isn't he handsome! I think he's absolutely gorgeous!": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Prefabs/Building System/Furniture/Shop Lists/antique_list.asset": {"FurnitureShopItemsList:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Prefabs/Building System/Furniture/Shop Lists/calendar_list_001.asset": {"FurnitureShopItemsList:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Prefabs/Building System/Furniture/Shop Lists/kitchen_list.asset": {"FurnitureShopItemsList:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Prefabs/Building System/Furniture/Shop Lists/sign_list.asset": {"FurnitureShopItemsList:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Rain Any": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Rain Heavy": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Lamp": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Talk": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}, "Rain": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets12.assets"]}}}